WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:19.352 --> 00:00:20.145
Theo!

00:00:20.937 --> 00:00:21.855
Eddy--

00:00:22.856 --> 00:00:25.275
-Damn it!
-Theo!

00:00:25.608 --> 00:00:27.360
He's reaching the limit.

00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:46.921
Oh, no!

00:00:47.839 --> 00:00:48.673
Theo!

00:01:41.309 --> 00:01:42.602
You haven't changed.

00:01:44.437 --> 00:01:45.271
Tell me why.

00:01:47.649 --> 00:01:50.151
You wouldn't understand.

00:01:51.778 --> 00:01:53.947
Theo! Theo! Are you okay?

00:01:58.618 --> 00:01:59.452
No...

00:01:59.828 --> 00:02:00.954
I'm sorry.

00:02:02.122 --> 00:02:03.456
It looks like...

00:02:04.124 --> 00:02:05.458
I won't be able to help you.

00:02:06.292 --> 00:02:07.252
That's not...

00:02:09.712 --> 00:02:12.549
Give this to my family.

00:02:17.804 --> 00:02:19.139
Don't give up yet!

00:02:29.274 --> 00:02:30.150
Harry!

